    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d122">

                <pb facs="0215" n="141" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg141"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Adams..</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1792.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-06-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 26, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to instruction No. 1843 from this
                    department in regard to be disposition to be made by you of the first instalment
                    of the Simonoseki iniemnity, which has been paid by the Japanese government, I
                    now transmit for your information, and with a view to the carrying out of the
                    instructions upon that subject heretofore sent you, a copy of a despatch<anchor
                        n="*" xml:id="d122-f1"/> of the 13th of April from Mr. Portman, our chargé
                    d’affaires ad <hi rendition="#italic">interim</hi> at Yedo, together with the
                    original receipt, in quadruplicate, signed by the officer in charge of the
                    British commission at Yokohama, for the sum of five hundred thousand dollars,
                    $500,000,) or one hundred and six thousand and two hundred and fifty pounds
                    sterling (£106,250.)</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Francis Adams</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d122-f1" n="*" xml:id="d122-f1-content">
                <p>For enclosure see correspondence with Japan.</p>
            </note>
